config CODEX_OPEN_SOURCE_BUILD
    bool
    default y
    help
        Source-only build: no device-bound encrypted update service.

config CODEX_RECOVERY_PATH_PROVEN
    bool
    default y
    help
        Enables the native USB Codex HID/CDC identity only after a forced ROM
        download through BOOT/GPIO0 or the separate CH343/UART0 path has been
        proven on the target board. This option is intentionally not writable
        through NVS, CDC, BLE, or the on-device menu.

config CODEX_DEVELOPMENT_HIL
    bool "Enable development-only UART HIL and display diagnostics"
    default n
    help
        Adds the @hil UART0 command plane, raw RGB565 framebuffer sampling,
        VSYNC timing telemetry, and automated input injection. Production
        builds must leave this disabled; all related sources and hooks are then
        removed at compile time.

config CODEX_CHARGE_MAX_MA
    int "Validated battery charge ceiling (mA)"
    range 200 1200
    default 200
    help
        Factory-safe source default is 200 mA. Higher settings require a
        suitable single-cell battery, input supply and thermal validation.
        PMIC die protection is not battery temperature monitoring.
